{"sections":[],"primaryContentSections":[{"declarations":[{"languages":["swift"],"platforms":["macOS"],"tokens":[{"text":"@","kind":"attribute"},{"text":"MainActor","kind":"attribute","preciseIdentifier":"s:ScM"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"text":"struct","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"OUDSLegacyLayoutModifier","kind":"identifier"}]}],"kind":"declarations"},{"kind":"content","content":[{"type":"heading","level":2,"anchor":"overview","text":"Overview"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"If an app is compiled with Xcode 27 for iOS 27, Liquid Glass is forced by the system and considered as enabled by OUDS."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"If an app is compiled with Xcode 26 for iOS 26, the "},{"type":"emphasis","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"UIDesignRequiresCompatibility"}]},{"text":" flag is read and OUDS considers wether or not Liquid Glass is enabled.","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"If an app is compiled with Xcode 26 for iOS 18 and lower, Liquid Glass is considered as unavailable, disabled.","type":"text"}]},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The edge case is when the OS version is 27, the flag "},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"UIDesignRequiresCompatibility"}],"type":"emphasis"},{"type":"text","text":" stils exists but the app is compiled with Xcode 26."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"This case is extreme: the system does not force Liquid Glass, the flag is here, and OUDS cannot only rely on the OS version."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"Thus, this "},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/OUDSComponents\/documentation\/OUDSComponents\/OUDSLegacyLayoutModifier","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"text":"  will define an environment value saying any legacy layout things (appearances, selector, divider) must be displayed.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"**You must use this ","type":"text"},{"code":"ViewModifier","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" with care, and only if you are using Xcode 26 and  ","type":"text"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"UIDesignRequiresCompatibility"}],"type":"emphasis"},{"text":" to YES **.","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"Prefer build with Xcode 27 without the ","type":"text"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"UIDesignRequiresCompatibility","type":"text"}],"type":"emphasis"},{"text":"  flag.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"code":["  OUDSTabBar(selectedTab: ..., count: ...) { ... )","    .modifier(OUDSLegacyLayoutModifier())"],"type":"codeListing","syntax":"swift"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Note: You should use this view modifier in your root view because the flag it defines in deeper levels is used for all navigations components like bars"}]}]},{"type":"aside","style":"note","content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"3.0.0"}],"type":"paragraph"}],"name":"Since"}]}],"identifier":{"url":"doc:\/\/OUDSComponents\/documentation\/OUDSComponents\/OUDSLegacyLayoutModifier","interfaceLanguage":"swift"},"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/OUDSComponents\/documentation\/OUDSComponents"]]},"variants":[{"paths":["\/documentation\/oudscomponents\/oudslegacylayoutmodifier"],"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}]}],"schemaVersion":{"minor":3,"major":0,"patch":0},"abstract":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":"ViewModifier"},{"text":" to manage an edge case about Liquid Glass configuration of Apple OS and Xcode versions.","type":"text"}],"relationshipsSections":[{"identifiers":["doc:\/\/OUDSComponents\/s8SendableP","doc:\/\/OUDSComponents\/s16SendableMetatypeP","doc:\/\/OUDSComponents\/7SwiftUI12ViewModifierP"],"kind":"relationships","type":"conformsTo","title":"Conforms To"}],"kind":"symbol","metadata":{"fragments":[{"text":"struct","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"OUDSLegacyLayoutModifier","kind":"identifier"}],"roleHeading":"Structure","